&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1938&quot; data-local-id=&quot;60c4936da594&quot;&gt;Experience with cloud/compute capacity management or GPU infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2013&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5372336307f1&quot;&gt;Background in large-scale datacenter rollouts&lt;/p&gt;
